raw/photos/
# Per project: keep the recipe, drop the pixels.
# Tracked: plan/*.md, spec.json, every prompt and lock .txt, raw/ sources.
# Ignored: images, video, audio and logs wherever they sit.
projects/**/*.png
projects/**/*.jpg
projects/**/*.jpeg
projects/**/*.webp
projects/**/*.gif
projects/**/*.mov
projects/**/*.mp4
projects/**/*.mp3
projects/**/*.wav
projects/**/*.log
# film_run up-to-date stamps, not recipe
projects/*/clips/*_trim.txt
# large or personal source sets stay out entirely
projects/dragon_epic/raw/
projects/lost_city/raw/

tools/draw-things-community/
tools/*.log
